'''Day of Judgment''' (神判の日, ''Kamiban no Hi'', '''Day of the Divine Seal''') is the second event in the series of [[:Category:Cyclone Stages#Advanced Cyclone Stages|Advanced Cyclone Stages]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]]. It appears on the '''20th''' and '''21st''' of every month.

